    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="colophon">
    <b>Speed Is the Moat</b> &mdash; a verified inquiry by Anuj Sadani, 2026.<br>
      Repository, full report, and verification workspace:
      <b>github.com/asadani/speed-is-the-moat</b><br>
      Built on 33 captured sources and 65 claims bound to exact quotations, each
      checked against its snapshot before this text was allowed to ship.<br>
      Set in Archivo, Source Serif 4, and IBM Plex Mono.<br>
      Text licensed CC BY 4.0 &mdash; use it freely, credit the author. Captured
